constraints:
1 ≤ N ≤ 10^{5} 
1 ≤ Arr[i] ≤ 10^{6}

expected time complexity: O(N)
expected auxiliary space: O(1)

standard_solution_code:
class Solution:

	def equilibrium(self, arr, n):
		s = sum(arr)
		pre_sum = 0
		for i in range(n):
			if pre_sum == s - pre_sum - arr[i]:
				return 'YES'
			pre_sum += arr[i]
		return 'NO'
